<page xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
      xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="urn:magento:framework:View/Layout/etc/page_configuration.xsd">

    <!--
      Category listing is served natively (MySQL) for now. The custom
      Block\Product\ListProduct -> Model\Search\ProductSearch path injects the raw
      AdvancedSearch ClientInterface (no DI preference -> "Cannot instantiate
      interface" on category pages) and the block/template contract is incomplete.
      Serving category listings from OpenSearch is Phase 2 (read path) / 2L (layered
      nav) — see docs/OPENSEARCH-SERVING-LAYER-PLAN.md. Disabled to keep category
      pages working until that lands.
    -->
    <body>
        <!--
            Product ids for the listing, so impressions do not depend on theme markup. Hyvä happens
            to render data-product-id on its cards; Luma — and therefore Breeze — renders nothing of
            the kind, so relying on it collected impressions on one theme out of three and reported
            an empty denominator on the others. Placed at the end of the body so the listing block
            has already loaded its collection: this reads that collection, it never builds one.
        -->
        <referenceContainer name="before.body.end">
            <block class="ParkkTech\FastMagentoPersonalization\Block\Analytics\ListingMarker"
                   name="fastmagento.analytics.listing_marker"
                   template="ParkkTech_FastMagentoPersonalization::analytics/listing-products.phtml"/>
        </referenceContainer>
    </body>
</page>
